        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(c) In determining reasonable absence, consideration shall be given to the relationship of the Employee to the deceased and the responsibility of the Employee for making funeral arrangements. However, for deaths of a husband, wife, partner, son, daughter, mother or father, a reasonable absence shall not exceed five (5) consecutive Scheduled Daily Tours.",
