        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(↑) In the event that it is necessary for an Employee to be absent for a death in his or her immediate family, as provided in Article 16, Paragraph 5, on a day the Employee had previously scheduled as a paid vacation day, such day shall be rescheduled, provided however, that no more than a combination of three (3) Vacation days and Excused Work Days rescheduled in accordance with Article 25, Excused Work Days shall be rescheduled for such purposes.",
